{"about_the_game":"Funko Fusion is a third-person action game that\u2019s all about celebrating fandom. Play with some of your favorite characters from across TV, movies, games, and comics, and explore handcrafted worlds inspired by Jurassic World, Back to the Future, JAWS, The Thing, Chucky, Battlestar Galactica, Hot Fuzz, The Umbrella Academy, Five Nights at Freddy\u2019s, Masters of the Universe, Invincible, and many more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/ca6ae364bb3262a1603be552bd675b0f.poster.avif?t=1763993341\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/ca6ae364bb3262a1603be552bd675b0f.webm?t=1763993341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/ca6ae364bb3262a1603be552bd675b0f.mp4?t=1763993341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Select, unlock, and play with 60+ unique playable characters from more than 20 fan-favorite franchises, all lovingly recreated in Funko Pop! form. <br><br>Each character has their own weapons and special moves, and some characters have unique skills for solving puzzles and finding secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/55b4942896bb34a4417f56d987d7ea76.poster.avif?t=1763993341\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/55b4942896bb34a4417f56d987d7ea76.webm?t=1763993341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/55b4942896bb34a4417f56d987d7ea76.mp4?t=1763993341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore your favorite franchises in video game form, relive memorable moments, and play through a unique story that ties them all together!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/412f005745fdfc33ef66c64642569346.poster.avif?t=1763993341\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/412f005745fdfc33ef66c64642569346.webm?t=1763993341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1843310/extras/412f005745fdfc33ef66c64642569346.mp4?t=1763993341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Shoot, blast, and whack enemies in ranged and melee combat. Craft gadgets and items to give yourself an advantage or to unlock hidden areas.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Warrior Princess","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1843310/5c1304542c833d810ee410218e4ff83e0b3ae482.jpg"},{"name":"Wonderful World of Weaponry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1843310/42f815645314a2a58758a198683d9745b5b3bf01.jpg"},{"name":"Fly Into The Cosmic Death Storm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1843310/1621e389262a7bad3010eb6cf11e581bebdbb6e3.jpg"},{"name":"I'm the Daddy Here!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1843310/42c6001a68d52eeb989d9e017091079af6f882e0.jpg"},{"name":"Wait here for a little while","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1843310/f8285b341ab868f1931f15c1d0469915146bf925.jpg"},{"name":"The Bite of '87","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1843310/73fff83cbdd86b11e6575238403749c535f4ba10.jpg"},{"name":"Made you think about death and stuff","path":"https://cdn.aka